## Studio rig: soft ambient, a key from upper left and a weak fill from the right.
## The path tracer skips the ambient light; it computes bounce light instead.
LightSource "ambientlight" 1 "intensity" [0.25]
LightSource "distantlight" 2 "from" [-1 1.5 -2] "to" [0 0 0] "intensity" [1.1]
LightSource "distantlight" 3 "from" [2 0.5 -1] "to" [0 0 0] "intensity" [0.4]
